# Deny-by-default build context: the daemon receives ONLY what the
# Dockerfile compiles. Anything not re-included below never leaves
# the host — .env secrets, plans/, kit state, web/, docs/, and any
# future top-level path are excluded at upload time, not merely
# unCOPY'd. Guarded by scripts/check-build-context.mjs (F13).
**
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!cmd/**
!internal/
!internal/**
